	"TagLine": "Add more food retextures by Ghostpixxells to add to Lux's food mod",
	"Description": "Note: As of the recent PyTk update this mod might not work anymore\u00A0\n\nArt is originally from\u00A0[Pixel Mart](https://ghostpixxells.itch.io/pixel-mart)\uFEFF and\u00A0[Free Pixel food by ghostpixxells](https://ghostpixxells.itch.io/pixelfood)\uFEFF, which had open permissions (including commercial use) at the time of posting.\n\nThis mod is designed to be compatible with [Lux's Food Mod](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10035)\uFEFF at 2x zoom (its the folder with 32x32 sprites). This mod replaces some of the art from from that mod and also adds some new ones that were missing from that mod (and is used in Animal Husbandry).\n\nIn the screenshots I was testing this mod with [Animal Husbandry ](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1538)\uFEFFand [Love Of Cooking](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6830)\uFEFF.\n\nThis art has also been converted into Custom Clumps you can find in the mines here:\u00A0[Kaya's Food Clumps](https://kayainsdv.postype.com/post/10378364).\uFEFF",
